{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/006-tao-yao/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/006-tao-yao/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1/data.json","title":"詩經注析 · 桃之夭夭，灼灼其华。之子于归，宜其室家。 · 程俊英、蒋见元","description":"風 · 周南 · 桃夭 · 《詩經注析》关于“桃之夭夭，灼灼其华。之子于归，宜其室家。”的注脚：夭夭释为桃树少壮盛貌，灼灼释为花色鲜明。书中引《说文》及严粲等说说明桃花正盛之状，并指出“之子”就是这位出嫁的新娘，“于归”是古代女子出嫁称归之…"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"006-tao-yao","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","glossId":"0002-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/006-tao-yao/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1","poem":{"id":"006-tao-yao","title":"桃夭","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"zhounan","path":["風","周南","桃夭"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"桃之夭夭","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"灼灼其华","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"之子于归","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"宜其室家","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"桃之夭夭","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"有蕡其实","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"之子于归","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"宜其家室","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"桃之夭夭","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"其叶蓁蓁","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"之子于归","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"宜其家人","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","title":"詩經注析","authors":["程俊英","蔣見元"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","era":"现代","publicationYear":1991,"carrier":"PDF"},"annotation":{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"桃之夭夭，灼灼其华。之子于归，宜其室家。","targetNotes":"第一章。","sourceLabel":"第 37-38 页","sourceNotes":"第 37 页页下至 38 页上半。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":null,"text":"夭夭释为桃树少壮盛貌，灼灼释为花色鲜明。书中引《说文》及严粲等说说明桃花正盛之状，并指出“之子”就是这位出嫁的新娘，“于归”是古代女子出嫁称归之义。“宜其室家”则释为善处夫妻关系，作者并引陈奂、毛传诸说，说明“宜”有和善得宜之意，“室家”指配偶与夫妻之家。本章韵读属鱼部。","notes":"据第 38 页首章注释。"}]},"siblings":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"layerLabel":"全篇总说","title":"这是一首贺新嫁